    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18275" root="زنو" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَنِىٌّ</span></b>  <i>Strait,</i> or <i>narrow;</i> (K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَنَآءٌ</span></b> :
(TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زنأ</span> from the Fáïk; and in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زن</span>:)
the former mentioned in this sense by IAar;
(TA;) applied to a bag, or other receptacle.
(K, TA.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَنِىْءٌ</span>, in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زنأ</span>.]

